  "calibration_note": "the ECE bound is DERIVED: each bin's realised accuracy is a binomial mean whose own noise is sqrt(acc(1-acc)/n), weighted the same way ECE is. A perfectly calibrated mind still shows that much on this many questions, so the gate is ECE under its own noise floor and no threshold was chosen by taste",
